{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two people stood on the bridge. They smiled and looked into each other's eyes. Suddenly, the boy whispered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I know everything.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girl shuddered with terror. A third participant in the drama entered the scene - a knife. The corpse fell and disappeared into the raging river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that's for the last day. As of right now.......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* &gt;5 unique endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* &gt;19 CG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Walkthrough: 40-50 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615870?t=1743099006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615870/b6ecabbf02f51a33d1cb5a5c53cb5f7d12d1cabd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743099006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615870/2c03c93efbb7f49f14bffd22f886b415215855d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743099006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615870/2c03c93efbb7f49f14bffd22f886b415215855d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743099006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depression, suicide, drinking alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two people stood on the bridge. They smiled and looked into each other's eyes. Suddenly, the boy whispered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I know everything.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girl shuddered with terror. A third participant in the drama entered the scene - a knife. The corpse fell and disappeared into the raging river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that's for the last day. As of right now.......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph